      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al décimo día, llegaron a la tierra de los lotófagos, los comedores de loto.",
          "en": "On the tenth day, they reached the land of the Lotus-Eaters."
        },
        {
          "es": "Odiseo mandó a tres hombres a averiguar quién vivía allí.",
          "en": "Odysseus sent three men to find out who lived there."
        },
        {
          "es": "La gente era amable. Les dieron a los hombres su comida: el dulce fruto del loto.",
          "en": "The people there were friendly. They gave the men their food: the sweet fruit of the lotus."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero quien comía el loto lo olvidaba todo. Olvidaba su casa, y solo quería quedarse a comer más.",
          "en": "But whoever ate the lotus forgot everything. They forgot their homes, and wanted only to stay and eat more."
        }
      ],
