      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Siguieron navegando, tristes y cansados, hasta llegar a la tierra de los Cíclopes.",
          "en": "They sailed on, sad and tired, until they reached the land of the Cyclopes."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los Cíclopes eran gigantes con un solo ojo redondo en medio de la frente.",
          "en": "The Cyclopes were giants with one round eye in the middle of their foreheads."
        },
        {
          "es": "No tenían leyes ni asambleas. Cada uno vivía en una cueva con su familia, y hacía lo que quería.",
          "en": "They had no laws and no meetings. Each one lived in a cave with his family, and did as he pleased."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cerca había una isla pequeña y salvaje, llena de cabras. Una noche oscura, sin luna, los barcos llegaron allí.",
          "en": "Nearby was a small wild island, full of goats. On a dark night with no moon, the ships landed there."
        }
