          "en": "He threw it down with a crash. The men ran to hide in the dark corners."
        },
        {
          "es": "Metió sus ovejas. Después levantó una piedra enorme, y cerró la entrada de la cueva.",
          "en": "He drove his sheep inside. Then he lifted a huge stone, and closed the door of the cave."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esa piedra era tan grande que ni veintidós carros la habrían podido mover.",
          "en": "That stone was so big that twenty-two wagons could not have moved it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Encendió el fuego, y su único ojo los vio. «¡Forasteros! ¿Quiénes son ustedes?»",
          "en": "He lit a fire, and his one eye saw them. “Strangers! Who are you?”"
        }
