      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "«Somos griegos, volvemos de Troya», dijo Odiseo. «Respeta a los dioses. Zeus protege a los huéspedes.»",
          "en": "“We are Greeks, on our way home from Troy,” said Odysseus. “Respect the gods. Zeus protects all guests.”"
        },
        {
          "es": "El gigante se rió. «A los Cíclopes no nos importa Zeus.»",
          "en": "The giant laughed. “We Cyclopes do not care about Zeus.”"
        },
        {
          "es": "Se llamaba Polifemo, y era hijo de Poseidón, el dios del mar.",
          "en": "His name was Polyphemus, and he was a son of the sea god, Poseidon."
        },
